        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Danny Elfman, Alf Clausen\n- Products: The Simpsons\n- Topics: Theme music, television scoring, orchestration\n\nFacts:\n- In 1989, Danny Elfman composed the theme music for the animated television series The Simpsons.\n- The current arrangement of The Simpsons theme music is by Alf Clausen.\n- Alf Clausen has scored or orchestrated music for more than 30 films and television shows.",
